      {
        "_type": "introSection",
        "_key": "intro",
        "heading": "About\nPenelope Social",
        "intro": "Penelope is a neighborhood gem in the heart of Vaughan. Born from the passion of three brothers who believe in the power of great food, refreshing drinks, and bringing people together. With a focus on fresh sourdough, comfort food, and carefully crafted cocktails, we’ve created a space where every detail feels like home. It’s all about great flavors, good times, and making memories with the people you care about.",
